{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34428","headline":"早秋吴体寄袭美 · 陆龟蒙","name":"早秋吴体寄袭美","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荒庭古树只独倚，败蝉残蛩苦相仍。\n虽然诗胆大如斗，争奈愁肠牵似绳。\n短烛初添蕙幌影，微风渐折蕉衣棱。\n安得弯弓似明月，快箭拂下西飞鹏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}